~~~

== D. Statistics & Probability

=== C16 \[Core\] The Two-Headed Coin \/ 双面正硬币
*中文：* 罐中有 999 枚公平硬币和 1 枚双面都是正面的硬币。随机取一枚并连续掷出 10 次正面。它是双面正硬币的后验概率是多少？

*English:* A jar contains 999 fair coins and one double-headed coin. A randomly selected coin produces ten consecutive heads. What is the posterior probability that it is double-headed?

~~~
{}{raw}
<details class="answer"><summary>Solution</summary><div class="answer-content">
<p>Bayes' rule gives</p><p class="equation-line">$$\frac{(1/1000)\cdot1}{(1/1000)\cdot1+(999/1000)\cdot2^{-10}}=\frac{1024}{2023}\approx0.5062.$$</p><p>Ten heads are strong evidence, but the prior odds against the special coin are 999 to 1.</p>
</div></details>
~~~

=== C17 \[Core\] Disease Test and Base Rate \/ 疾病检测与基准率
*中文：* 疾病患病率为 0.5\%；患者检测必为阳性，健康者假阳性率为 7\%。随机一人检测阳性，其患病概率是多少？

*English:* Disease prevalence is 0.5\%. Sensitivity is 100\%, and the false-positive rate is 7\%. For a random person who tests positive, what is the disease probability?

~~~
{}{raw}
<details class="answer"><summary>Solution</summary><div class="answer-content">
<p>By Bayes' rule,</p><p class="equation-line">$$\Pr(D\mid+)=\frac{0.005}{0.005+0.995(0.07)}\approx0.0669.$$</p><p>Despite perfect sensitivity, most positives are false because the condition is rare.</p>
</div></details>
~~~

=== C18 \[Medium\] Waiting for Consecutive Heads \/ 等待连续正面
*中文：* 每次独立抛一枚正面概率为 $p$ 的硬币。等待连续 2 个正面和连续 3 个正面的期望抛掷次数分别是多少？

*English:* Independent tosses have head probability $p$. What are the expected waiting times for two consecutive heads and for three consecutive heads?

~~~
{}{raw}
<details class="answer"><summary>Solution</summary><div class="answer-content">
<p>Using states equal to the current run length and solving the first-step recurrences gives the general formula</p><p class="equation-line">$$\mathbb E[T_k]=\frac{1+p+\cdots+p^{k-1}}{p^k}.$$</p><p>Thus</p><p class="equation-line">$$\mathbb E[T_2]=\frac{1+p}{p^2},\qquad \mathbb E[T_3]=\frac{1+p+p^2}{p^3}.$$</p>
</div></details>
~~~

=== C19 \[Core\] Broken-Stick Triangle \/ 断棍成三角形
*中文：* 在单位线段上独立均匀选两个断点。三段能组成三角形的概率是多少？

*English:* Two independent uniform breakpoints split a unit stick into three pieces. What is the probability that the pieces form a triangle?

~~~
{}{raw}
<details class="answer"><summary>Solution</summary><div class="answer-content">
<p>A triangle is possible iff every piece is shorter than $1/2$. In the unit-square representation of the two breakpoints, the failure regions where one piece is at least $1/2$ have total area $3/4$. Therefore the success probability is <strong>$1/4$</strong>.</p>
</div></details>
~~~

=== C20 \[Core\] Meeting at the Station \/ 车站会面
*中文：* 两人在 1 点至 2 点之间独立均匀到达，各等待 15 分钟但不超过 2 点。两人碰面的概率是多少？

*English:* Two people independently arrive uniformly between 1:00 and 2:00 and each waits 15 minutes, never beyond 2:00. What is the probability that they meet?

~~~
{}{raw}
<details class="answer"><summary>Solution</summary><div class="answer-content">
<p>Let arrival times $X,Y$ be measured in hours. They meet iff $|X-Y|\le1/4$. The two failure triangles in the unit square have total area $(3/4)^2$. Hence</p><p class="equation-line">$$\Pr(\text{meet})=1-\left(\frac34\right)^2=\frac7{16}.$$</p>
</div></details>
~~~

*书目定位：* 本页覆盖原书 Chapter 1 的逻辑与定量题、Chapter 2 的衍生品题、Chapter 3 的金融经济学题，以及 Chapter 4 的统计与概率题；行为面试清单不纳入数学题库。
